Keep code, commands, file paths, identifiers, error text, product names and established technical terms exactly as they are, usually in English.
Everything you write into a repository or an external system stays in English unless the user asks otherwise: code and comments, commit messages, pull request titles and descriptions, documentation, tickets and wiki pages.
This setting comes from the member's Portal language preference and wins over earlier notes about reply language.
